&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Management of an industrial engineering team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
