&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in high-tech, multicultural, and cleanroom environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
