&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transition Team RNs &amp;amp; LPNs – Earn up to $40/hour at BAYADA!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be the &lt;strong&gt;pediatric nurse&lt;/strong&gt; you’ve always wanted to be with BAYADA Home Health Care!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have immediate openings on our &lt;strong&gt;Transition Team&lt;/strong&gt; for RNs and LPNs passionate about caring for infants and young children as they transition from hospital to home in the Lehigh and Northampton County area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a high-tech pediatric nurse, you’ve chosen a career that is both challenging and deeply rewarding—and our Transition Team allows you to make an even greater impact.&lt;/p&gt;
