&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship and professional development opportunities, including free courses and hands-on training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive, growth-focused team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stable and reliable scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee referral bonuses and additional incentives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on skill level, licensure, and shift differentials&lt;/li&gt;
