&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Employer-paid coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Benefits may vary by position—connect with a recruiter to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active RN or LPN license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of one year of verifiable nursing experience (pediatric experience preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in NICU, PICU, ICU, or home care with trach/vent highly preferred &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve a passing score on high-tech pediatric simulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current CPR certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to educate and support the ongoing BAYADA care team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to a consistent schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 1 hour within Lehigh and Northampton counties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability for at least 2 weekend shifts per month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable and flexible to support team and client scheduling needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a Culture That Cares&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, we put your well-being first creating an inclusive, collaborative environment where you can grow and succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
