&lt;li&gt;Named a &lt;em&gt;Forbes Best Employer for Women (2020)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized as a &lt;em&gt;Glassdoor Best Place to Work (2018 &amp;amp; 2019)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awarded &lt;em&gt;America’s Greatest Workplaces for Diversity (2023)&lt;/em&gt; by Newsweek&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrated 50 years in the business of serving our communities &lt;em&gt;(2025)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong culture rooted in compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Small, local tenured teams that make a big impact&lt;/li&gt;
