remotely-hellofresh:greenhouse:7775172.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Logistics Transport Manager has end-to-end responsibility for the transport function, owning the overall P&amp;amp;L, service performance, and strategic design of the transport network. Covering final mile, middle mile, inter-site transfers, and supplier inbound collections, this role is accountable for reducing total transport cost while improving service, efficiency, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role combining strategy, network design, commercial management, and hands-on operational management , with responsibility for people, partners, and systems (TMS/YMS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full P&amp;amp;L ownership for the transport function, with accountability for budget setting, forecasting, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead transport network design and optimisation, ensuring the most efficient use of locations, routes, and linehaul.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the middle mile haulage strategy, including carrier selection, contract negotiation, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage commercial relationships with haulage partners, ensuring service, cost, and compliance expectations are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the&amp;nbsp; business owner for Transport Management System (TMS) working together with our global technical teams for development and implementation of improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior management across final mile multidrop routes, intersite transfers, inbound collections, and middle mile haulage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and route our B2C final mile multidrop delivery routes, ensuring optimal route efficiency, cost control, and excellent customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan Ex Works supplier collections ensuring robust &amp;amp; scalable solutions including contingency measures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate intersite transfers to ensure timely and efficient movement of stock between production locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and schedule of inbound &amp;amp; outbound collections, working closely with suppliers, carriers and internal teams to prevent site congestion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage strong UK road network knowledge to plan effective routes and mitigate risks such as congestion, road restrictions, and delays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and manage the transport team, setting clear objectives driving high performance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a senior transport&amp;nbsp; management role with P&amp;amp;L responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing and planning multidrop B2C delivery operations with a focus on efficiency and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UK transport networks, final mile, middle mile, and linehaul operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in reducing transport cost through network optimisation, commercial negotiation, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing haulage contracts and third-party transport providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience owning or managing TMS and YMS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership experience, managing managers and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPC qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nursery support scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: HelloFresh UK, Unit 2, Collaboration Way, Smartparc, Derby, DE21 7HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts: &lt;/strong&gt;Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/p&gt;

remotely-hellofresh:greenhouse:7818358.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;S&#39;more about the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Chief Product Officer, Canada and in partnership with a broader North America Sustainability team, the Sustainability Manager will lead data-driven food and packaging waste reduction and lean production initiatives throughout the Canadian operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will actively identify new opportunities and drive projects for more sustainable solutions across our product offering, including kit and case modifications, changes to ingredient packaging, logistics optimizations, and auditing and reducing waste within our production facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be accountable for our environmental, social, and governance (ESG) reporting pillar for Canada. This involves the collection of inputs from across the business that contribute to the Annual Non-Financial Report for the HelloFresh Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will ensure compliance with the external reporting requirements and prepare company processes and capabilities to meet the needs of the upcoming CSRD (Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive of the European Union applicable as of 2024) reporting regulation, and other emerging reporting requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lettuce share what this role will be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage projects for Sustainability across HelloFresh brands and operations in Canada: HelloFresh, Chefs Plate, and Factor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase customer trust in our food and packaging and reduce the friction of the conscientious consumer in selecting our products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and share reporting on Sustainability practices for our Canadian business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish relationships with internal and external stakeholders to deliver the strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with Global and North American teams on existing responsible sourcing targets and initiatives; facilitate development and roll out of high-impact initiatives in the Canadian market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify areas for packaging reduction and recyclability in support of reducing EPR costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of existing and pending regulation and climate goals (at the federal, provincial and municipal level); ensure our compliance in both reporting and adherence to guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us build and drive forward and contribute to our Product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the Canadian team’s understanding and enthusiasm for Sustainability; ensure adherence to best practices and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support growth, development, and internal alignment as a member of the Canadian Product Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All other duties, as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound a-peeling? Here&#39;s what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in business, engineering, supply chain management, or a sustainability-related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of relevant work experience (consulting, sustainability, operations) with roles driving sustainability-related projects and/or waste management and auditing preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to large operations, including distribution centers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in computer applications / software (Google Sheets, Excel) complemented with exceptional analytical and problem solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle multiple projects and assignments, while being able to prioritize, achieve objectives, and meet deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ownership mindset and ability to work independently with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and process orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven team player, with strong interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in delivering or supporting sustainability programs at a national level would be considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Professional Certification in sustainability would be considered an asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s cut to the cheese, this is why you&#39;ll love it here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box Discount &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Amazing discounts on 1 box per week! 75% discount on weekly HelloFresh and Chefs Plate meal kits AND 50% off weekly Factor meal box.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Dental benefits from day 1, a Health Spending Account, unlimited access to the Headspace app to meet your self-care needs, and 25% discount on GoodLife fitness memberships!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;RRSP Matching - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Competitive RRSP matching program offered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vacation &amp;amp; PTO &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Time off is also an important part of self-care! We offer generous vacation and PTO to help you create a good work-life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Family Benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- A parental leave top-up program for expectant parents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - We support your career progression, provide development opportunities, and invest in your continued learning through our organization wide L&amp;amp;D fund.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work Hard &amp;amp; Have Fun&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - From team socials to engaging company days, you’ll have plenty of opportunity to experience the fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Initiatives &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;With impactful ERG’s like FreshPride, Women Empowered and LIMES, we are committed to our diversity, equity &amp;amp; inclusion efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Food Puns&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - this one is kind of a big dill if you haven’t already noticed. We even have some punny meeting room names!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Approach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we know that flexible work arrangements are essential in enabling you to do your best work, while balancing your personal and life needs. Offering remote work flexibility, along with the opportunity to interact and collaborate in the office are all a part of creating a great employee experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To meet these needs, we are pleased to provide Flexible Hybrid work. Flexible Hybrid is a people-first approach that is based on choice, trust, personalization, and empowers teams to choose when and how often they work from the office and work from home, in addition to team days and company days. This means a minimum of 2 days in office per week, with most teams in office between 2-3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;It’s no surprise that as a food company, we use many ingredients that may be considered common allergens (i.e. peanuts, tree nuts, milk, etc.). Whether this role is based out of our headquarters or one of our distribution centers, it is possible that you may be exposed to such allergens in this role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you have any concerns with being exposed to any particular food ingredients, including meat, please disclose this during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HelloFresh Canada uses AI-integrated technology to help us process and evaluate applications more efficiently. This includes tools that screen and assess candidate qualifications based on the requirements for this role. While these tools assist our workflow, all final selection decisions are made by our hiring team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a posting for an existing vacancy. We are actively seeking to fill this position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in joining the HelloFresh team? Don’t be chai, apply! Submit your application in PDF format today. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

